  "stageId": "main_06-03",
  "title": "同时走失",
  "storyCode": "6-3",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_06-03_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "11cf5cb4d42139a2830f4adde0f5df5da651f32da9fd6497e7a12ad5f27c3882",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第三关（前）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "text": "梅菲斯特？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "text": "你刚才释放了什么法术？你的......队伍，比之前更狂躁了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "text": "他们......他们很痛苦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "啊，你看到了啊？我种下去的种子开花了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "没事的，浮士德，他们不会攻击我们。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "text": "你还在催化他们的感染？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "text": "梅菲斯特......停手吧。我们能活下去的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "只有我的法术能做到这种事情，也只有这样，我们才有可能逃出去！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "你在侦察的时候也看得很清楚了吧，如果我们以现在的状态强行突破，近卫局在我们抵达贫民区的秘密通道之前，就能把我们全杀掉！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "你以前见过那些武器吗？那些连切尔诺伯格的守卫都没用过的武器！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "他们太熟悉这座城市了，而我们只是些外来人！他们从哪里出现？又会在哪里消失？！仅凭现在这点人，我们没法与他们正面对抗！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "切尔诺伯格的乌萨斯人太弱了......龙门把我们当军队看待，可我们不是军队，我们带领着的，只是些想活下去的同胞。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "text": "声音轻些。我们的士气相当低落。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "但我的牧群根本不会因为这种事情动摇！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "text": "......还有刚刚和我们汇合的很多整合运动成员在。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "text": "霜星一定会来支援我们。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "霜星？那个霜星？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "呵，呵呵，她和她的雪怪，难道不是也背叛了吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "text": "梅菲斯特！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "否则凭他们的实力，有什么能拦得住他们！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "我不怪他们。哪怕是背叛，他们也只是为了生存。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "text": "霜星不会背叛。我们不是说好了，要自己去看到真相？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "是啊......大家都在为了生存而努力。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "text": "别冲动，别被近卫局的计策冲昏头脑！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "我有办法，浮士德。我可以让我的同胞们更好地活下去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "text": "......？你要做什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "我要让近卫局看看比军队更可怕的东西。他们绝对无法想象我同胞们绽放出的花朵是什么样子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "text": "梅菲斯特？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "近卫局一定要为他们的所作所为付出代价......那个陈，一定要为伤害你付出代价！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "我的同胞们，我的族裔们，响应我吧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特的牧群",
      "text": "......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "你们的体内有着远比现在更旺盛的生命......去追索那种冲动，去散播你们的种子、你们的未来吧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "text": "不，梅菲斯特！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "text": "他们是活的人啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特的牧群",
      "text": "（混乱的尖叫声）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "整个龙门都是你们的土壤！去啊，去把你们的生命传递给其他人！快去，快去，快去！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "text": "啊？啊？！怎么回事？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "text": "你，你要干嘛？我们和你不是一个小队的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "text": "......我没在背后说过你们什么！也没说梅菲斯特......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "text": "队长？队长呢？！队长！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "text": "啊！！怎，怎么，你怎么咬我！！为什么......呃呃呃！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "text": "救命！！救命！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "text": "啊啊啊啊，啊！！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "哼哼......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "他们比以前更强了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "虽然他们已经听不见我的声音了，但他们不会再攻击我们......他们会越来越壮、越来越强、越来越多。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "龙门会被它们彻底毁灭。哼，我的同胞们得不到龙门，龙门人也别想继续保留这座城市！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "浮士德，走吧，我们......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "浮士德？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "text": "你做了什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "牧群",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "牧群",
      "text": "（痛苦的嘶嚎）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "浮士德？你去哪！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "浮士德！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "text": "为什么梅菲斯特的手下在攻击我们？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "text": "我好像看到......糟糕，糟糕，刚才被他们拖走的伊万......我看到了！伊万好像也变成那种样子了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "text": "苏卡，什么怪物......这是什么怪物！！打了他们也不会痛，刺了也不会死！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "text": "他们比刚才狂躁了好几倍！我们已经有点打不过了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "text": "你们，跟我来！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "text": "浮士德？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "text": "别去，可能是梅菲斯特的陷阱！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "text": "......这小子救过我的命。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "text": "梅菲斯特是个混蛋，他不一定。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "text": "从这里走，快。幻影弩手会保护你们。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "text": "知道了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "text": "谢谢......等，等下！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "text": "当心！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "text": "——源石投掷物？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "text": "快走！牧群的目标是你们！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "灰喉，敌人的动向很奇怪。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "重装干员会尽力维持阵线，我们术师着重削减敌人的数量，有法术能力的感染者，就交给你和其他狙击干员处理了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "text": "我射杀感染者，也是可以容许的吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "灰喉......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "有可能的话，我不容许任何人伤害感染者。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "只是，我是不是允许别人这么做，别人是不是允许感染者伤害其他人......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "没有任何意义。这些学说在战场上没有意义。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "如果真的有可能，没人应该伤害他人。无论是感染者还是普通人，都一样。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "text": "我会照做。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "嘉维尔会为我们提供医疗支援，所以......注意自己的状况，别受伤。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "......奇怪？那些是......梅菲斯特的牧群......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "但我......我怎么一点情感都感受不到？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "不对。不对！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "灰喉，快下来！事情不对！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "text": "它们......竟然在拔出身上的源石？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "灰喉！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "博士！你没事吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我没事！你小心！",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "text": "哪冒出来这么多牧群？动作都完全变了！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "text": "算了，你那位置还算比较安全！待在那别动！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "text": "我先把这些东西都解决了再说！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
